ng?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZwI9mXeWLgYQ7kNvwG6XyJS&_nc_oc=AdqwcrOlNRYq5Rah_xiZltK0bana0PJRDNZXU0sp0KrZik9yL3ydotEU0A_xthUsxms&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNgbf7dsHs_Llqr-wwhgw6jecPFsjS5tdW8TwkNhKIYew&oe=6AE209BE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover image.png", "id": "830206969419035", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617850_830206972752368_6340838414052752440_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Bkp2EnfRqCIQ7kNvwFogPUV&_nc_oc=AdrcvOeLxggiN0ReWbFwYhtUlpZ64pe-OX5BO01jY95BcrPi-3xN1FwiPD6rXvNawWA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMV4pbqlR3l3RN3c4HO4ooigFjRpG_vpmEYAiImo5iMLA&oe=6AE1F723"}, "display_name": "Speedway Race Clash: Ultimate \u2013 Demo", "keywords": ["Racing", "Formula1", "Cars", "Drive", "Simulator"], "long_description": " **Step into the race in VR \u2014 Demo Version**\n\n*Speedway Race Clash* is a fast-paced arcade racing experience built for Meta Quest. Jump into the driver\u2019s seat and compete in quick, intense races designed for VR.\n\n**Play the Demo**\n\u2022 2 playable tracks\n\u2022 1 Adrenaline car\n\u2022 7 AI opponents per race\n\u2022 Short races (20\u201330 seconds)\n\nExperience the core gameplay, handling, and speed of the game.\n\n **Preview the Full Experience**\nThe demo lets you see additional content available in the full version:\n\u2022 More tracks (up to 9 total)\n\u2022 GT and F1 car classes\n\u2022 Additional vehicles to unlock\n\nExplore what\u2019s waiting as you progress.\n\n **Built for VR Gameplay**\n\u2022 Fast, accessible racing\n\u2022 Smooth controls and responsive handling\n\u2022 Designed for quick sessions\n\n **Continue the Race**\nFinish the demo and jump into the full version to unlock all tracks, cars, and progression.\n\n **Start racing now and push for the lead.**\n", "short_description": "Try the  FREE VR racing demo!!\n\nPlay 2 tracks and fee